  {
   "id": "lawn-mowing-simulator-2-375076@major-2026-09-28",
   "gameId": "lawn-mowing-simulator-2-375076",
   "displayName": "Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 | News Update | 28/09/26",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-28T13:47:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Thank You!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First of all, a huge thank you to everyone for your patience, feedback and support since launch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The team has been working incredibly hard to work through the issues that have been reported. Your feedback has been extremely helpful in identifying where we need to focus, and we really appreciate everyone taking the time to report problems and share their experiences.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You may have already seen that the latest fixes have been pushed through across Steam, PlayStation. This update included ZTA 26s floating issues, ProView updates, Contract generation updates and visual updates which also went live on XBOX this morning!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "But we’re not stopping there.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re already working on further improvements and fixes, with the following hot fixes currently planned:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "This update will include",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Game save fixes related to previously playing the demo. We have updated the save system to stop some issues of the game not creating a suitable save file. This led to issues such as:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Equipment pre-purchased",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A black screen that stopped progress: Updated loading technique to improve performance and memory usage: Respawn option added to the Pause menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hotfix 03 – Steam, XBOX & PlayStation",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This update will bring the Hotfix 02 improvements across to consoles, alongside further platform-specific fixes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Respawn option on consoles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PS5 save issue fix – this should resolve some of the save-related problems being experienced",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance improvements, including foliage updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PS5 screen tearing fix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are aiming for both these updates to be live by the end of this week. However, if anything changes we will post an update to keep you all in the know.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ll continue to monitor feedback closely as these updates roll out and will keep working through the issues being reported. For any further feedback please use this link: https://skyhookgames.com/lms2_feedback/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you again for sticking with us, for your patience, and for helping us make Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There’s plenty more mowing to come!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
